+// Input from the phone app, in device pixels of the top-level window (main thread). Each goes to
+// the innermost visible child window under the point (the page's content widget).
+enum RetrofoxPointerAction { eRetrofoxPointerDown, eRetrofoxPointerMove, eRetrofoxPointerUp };
+void DispatchRetrofoxPointer(RetrofoxPointerAction aAction, int32_t aX, int32_t aY);
+// Scrolls by (aDX, aDY) device pixels at the last pointer position; positive aDY scrolls down.
